WEBVTT

00:14:27.623 --> 00:14:30.875
for the reduction of chemicals
in agricultural fresh produce.

00:14:31.716 --> 00:14:35.474
And thirdly, also to increase
awareness by the growers

00:14:35.498 --> 00:14:37.649
to the potential of this industry.

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:40.799
And this gap really narrows.

00:14:40.823 --> 00:14:43.438
Step by step, it does narrow.

00:14:44.557 --> 00:14:46.762
So I think my last slide is:

00:14:46.786 --> 00:14:49.051
All we are saying --
we can actually sing it --

00:14:49.075 --> 00:14:50.869
Give nature a chance.

00:14:50.893 --> 00:14:54.059
I'm saying it on behalf
of all the biocontrol practitioners

00:14:54.083 --> 00:14:55.397
and implementers,

00:14:55.421 --> 00:14:57.642
in Israel and abroad,

00:14:57.666 --> 00:14:59.698
really give nature a chance.

00:14:59.722 --> 00:15:00.881
Thank you.